    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's helpful. i've also been reading some stuff about how different populations might react differently to treatment or pain management in clinical settings. like, is there any biological basis for the idea that some ethnic groups have higher pain tolerances than others? i want to make sure i'm not falling for old myths if it comes up on the exam.",
